# Atomic publication decodes each batch member to the live target before
# projecting it, so the same value projects differently by path.
MODULE: QuiescentAtStampedVersionBatchUpcasts
TARGET: QuiescentAtStampedVersion
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: atomic publication projects the body upcast to the target
PERTURBS: ApplyBatch

--- FIND
           m1 == [k \in Keys |-> Proj(viewDefn, Input(e.vals[k]))]
--- REPLACE
           m1 == [k \in Keys |-> Proj(viewDefn, Decode(e.vals[k]))]
--- END
